00:23:23,220 --> 00:23:25,520
Let's burn the headquarters down!

267
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:28,080
Hold on, Ace!

268
00:23:28,340 --> 00:23:29,280
We're coming!

269
00:23:30,820 --> 00:23:32,100
Hmm. Impressive.

270
00:23:32,540 --> 00:23:35,187
That space could barely
fit one ship through.

271
00:23:35,380 --> 00:23:37,968
Yet here we are with a
boat full of pirates.

272
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:43,026
The walls were supposed to trap them, but
they might end up trapping us instead.

273
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,740
That's enough!

274
00:23:46,260 --> 00:23:48,100
He just won't give up.

275
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,240
Lucky break.

276
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:52,080
We got here right on time.

277
00:23:52,500 --> 00:23:53,460
Sit tight, Ace.

278
00:23:56,320 --> 00:23:58,380
Yeah, we did it!

279
00:23:59,760 --> 00:24:00,857
The platform!

280
00:24:00,940 --> 00:24:03,280
Ace is on the platform!

281
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:04,860
We can -

282
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,280
Oh, Snow! No!

283
00:24:15,140 --> 00:24:17,560
Save Ace for me, guys!

284
00:24:17,980 --> 00:24:19,400
Don't let them kill him!

285
00:24:33,460 --> 00:24:35,060
Oh, horse, why?

286
00:24:41,120 --> 00:24:45,380
Oh, my God.

287
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,100
It's Whitebeard!

288
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:26,400
Whitebeard has entered the plaza!

289
00:25:32,260 --> 00:25:36,060
My sons, please, stay back.

290
00:25:42,780 --> 00:25:44,097
Screaming.

291
00:25:44,180 --> 00:25:45,420
Screaming.

292
00:26:09,760 --> 00:26:11,437
Listen up, pirates!

293
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,980
Bring Ace to safety!

294
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:16,940
And once you're done with
that, destroy the Navy!

295
00:26:24,100 --> 00:26:26,220
Are you with me, Garp?

296
00:26:27,100 --> 00:26:27,930
Yeah.

297
00:26:31,420 --> 00:26:33,660
I fear we can't hold back anymore.

298
00:26:33,780 --> 00:26:36,800
This battle may be our last.

299
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,300
Thank you.
